---
// AutomateX How It Works Section: 3-Step Walkthrough with Visual Mockups
---

<section id="step" class="relative py-20 md:py-28 overflow-hidden bg-white">
  
  <!-- Subtle Atmospheric Pattern Assets -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden select-none -z-10">
    <img 
      src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69982176124aec6884c510af/69998b62eaab02fd131098d4_vector-11.png" 
      alt="BG Pattern" 
      class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-full max-w-4xl opacity-40 mix-blend-multiply" 
    />
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    
    <!-- Section Title -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center space-y-4 mb-16 md:mb-20">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-purple-200/90 bg-purple-50/60 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-[#5B21B6]">
        <span>Step-by-step workflow</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-[#100F12] tracking-tight font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans']">
        How it works
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[#5F5E6E] max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Connect sources, choose a template, and deploy with rules that your team can trust.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3 Step Items Stack -->
    <div class="space-y-12 sm:space-y-16">
      
      <!-- Step 01 -->
      <div class="bg-[#FAF9FC] border border-[#E9E5F2] rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-[0_16px_40px_rgba(20,15,40,0.04)] hover:shadow-[0_20px_50px_rgba(99,91,255,0.08)] transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center">
          
          <!-- Left: Step number & Heading (4 cols) -->
          <div class="lg:col-span-4 space-y-4 text-left">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-purple-200/80 shadow-xs flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-black text-[#5925DC] font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans']">
              01
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-[#100F12] font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans']">
              Add knowledge and boundaries
            </h3>
            <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[#5F5E6E] leading-relaxed">
              Bring your docs, help center, and internal pages. Define what the agent can use and what it must avoid.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Right: Visual Image Mockup (8 cols) -->
          <div class="lg:col-span-8 bg-white border border-slate-200/70 rounded-2xl p-3 sm:p-4 shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
            <img 
              src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69982176124aec6884c510af/69998860e04ec403eb2273b5_d016defd10694e16cec9ae26275fdbf2_step-01.png" 
              alt="Step 01 Mockup" 
              class="w-full h-auto rounded-xl object-contain"
              loading="lazy" 
            />
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 02 -->
      <div class="bg-[#FAF9FC] border border-[#E9E5F2] rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-[0_16px_40px_rgba(20,15,40,0.04)] hover:shadow-[0_20px_50px_rgba(99,91,255,0.08)] transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center">
          
          <!-- Left: Step number & Heading (4 cols) -->
          <div class="lg:col-span-4 space-y-4 text-left">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-purple-200/80 shadow-xs flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-black text-[#5925DC] font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans']">
              02
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-[#100F12] font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans']">
              Pick a template and set rules
            </h3>
            <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[#5F5E6E] leading-relaxed">
              Choose a template, set tone, decide when to escalate, and choose which actions need human approvals.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Right: Visual Image Mockup (8 cols) -->
          <div class="lg:col-span-8 bg-white border border-slate-200/70 rounded-2xl p-3 sm:p-4 shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
            <img 
              src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69982176124aec6884c510af/699989e4e5544e469fcd6356_509dd1bdb71a55cef6c49b47d19d4c93_step-02.png" 
              alt="Step 02 Mockup" 
              class="w-full h-auto rounded-xl object-contain"
              loading="lazy" 
            />
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 03 -->
      <div class="bg-[#FAF9FC] border border-[#E9E5F2] rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-[0_16px_40px_rgba(20,15,40,0.04)] hover:shadow-[0_20px_50px_rgba(99,91,255,0.08)] transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center">
          
          <!-- Left: Step number & Heading (4 cols) -->
          <div class="lg:col-span-4 space-y-4 text-left">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-purple-200/80 shadow-xs flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-black text-[#5925DC] font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans']">
              03
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-[#100F12] font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans']">
              Deploy to channels and tools
            </h3>
            <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[#5F5E6E] leading-relaxed">
              Run agents in chat, helpdesk, or internal workflows. Keep logs so teams can review and improve continuously.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Right: Visual Image Mockup (8 cols) -->
          <div class="lg:col-span-8 bg-white border border-slate-200/70 rounded-2xl p-3 sm:p-4 shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
            <img 
              src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69982176124aec6884c510af/699989e496125f9ce4e60286_bdd6bf25fbf4fbebf032830e56fa5feb_step-03.png" 
              alt="Step 03 Mockup" 
              class="w-full h-auto rounded-xl object-contain"
              loading="lazy" 
            />
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
